# Battle Movement System

## Network Line Restrictions
### Initial Line Assignment
- Battalions are assigned to specific network lines at battle start
- Line assignments are fixed throughout the battle
- Battalions cannot move between lines

### Movement Constraints
- Horizontal movement only along assigned network lines
- No diagonal or vertical movement between lines
- Must maintain connection to network at all times

## Movement Mechanics
### Pathfinding Priority
1. Follow network connection lines between nodes
2. Calculate optimal path to target using network topology
3. Stay within assigned network line
4. Maintain proper attack range from target

### Position Calculation
- Calculate distance from battalion to target
- Determine optimal attack position
- Account for battalion type and range
- Avoid collision with other battalions

## Movement Animation
### Visual Requirements
- Smooth transitions along network paths
- Clear indication of battalion movement state
- Consistent animation speed based on battalion type
- Proper cleanup of animation resources

### Animation Standards
- Use native driver for animations where possible
- Maintain 60fps performance target
- Implement proper cleanup on unmount
- Batch animation updates to reduce overhead

## Movement Synchronization
### State Coordination
- Sync movement state with combat actions
- Coordinate multiple battalion movements
- Handle interrupted movements (retargeting)
- Maintain performance during mass movement

### Real-time Updates
- Track battalion positions in real-time
- Update visual indicators smoothly
- Handle collision avoidance
- Manage animation transitions

## Performance Optimization
### Resource Management
- Monitor frame rate during pathfinding
- Track animation performance metrics
- Implement fallback strategies if needed
- Balance visual quality with performance

### Technical Requirements
- Efficient pathfinding along network
- Smooth animation transitions
- Real-time position tracking
- Proper resource cleanup

Remember: Movement must strictly adhere to network line restrictions while maintaining smooth gameplay experience. 